


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_25562fa5:



    voice "2SA_1048"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_1eec3e2d:


    "傍晚时分的广播室里，祥子用手指确认着桌子是否已经擦干净。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_3cf95105:



    voice "2SA_1049"
    sachiko "「呼……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_40fe7a39:


    "她叠好抹布，心满意足地坐下。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_bc51008f:



    voice "2SA_1050"
    sachiko "「这五年间每周都来从未中断哦。以我的性格来说，算是足够献身了吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_6a607901:



    voice "2SA_1051"
    sachiko "「……不对，这只是自我满足罢了」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_ce6e14aa:


    "祥子把手放在破烂的无线通讯机上，如此说道。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_ac707c21:



    voice "2SA_1052"
    sachiko "「但是，这也是最后一次来打扫这个房间了」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_3a0c4547:



    voice "2SA_1053"
    sachiko "「我要走了。宿管的工作也会辞掉。虽然没有什么目的地」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_38cc921f:


    "听上去就像是在做坟前汇报啊。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_56f2e203:



    voice "2SA_1054"
    sachiko "「我会和校长商量安排人时不时来这打扫一下的」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_acd7f8ce:



    voice "2SA_1055"
    sachiko "「永久供养是不可能了，但在校舍更换前总还是有办法的吧。至少不会变成被遗忘的角落」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_611002de:



    voice "2SA_1056"
    sachiko "「汇报这么突然，抱歉啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_ba11f9d8:



    voice "2SA_1057"
    sachiko "「……因为我必须在围巾织好前离开」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_78e6696a:



    voice "2SA_1058"
    sachiko "「你的围巾，我送给她了。她是打算手织一条回赠我吧……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_2fa6b81a:



    voice "2SA_1059"
    sachiko "「我看到她大半夜的在一片漆黑的楼梯过道上编围巾了。她怕吵醒房间里的其他人才去了那里」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_2c246a8d:



    voice "2SA_1060"
    sachiko "「说来，睡眠时间是别人两倍的圣夜子，不惜牺牲睡眠时间，做着她还不习惯的事情，你觉得会是为了谁呢？没错，是为了我哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_a88b8f76:



    voice "2SA_1061"
    sachiko "「那样太犯规了。尽耍小聪明。我怎么可能会上钩……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_0fd4d656:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_39b0ffb7:



    voice "2SA_1062"
    sachiko "「……被爱真是不妙」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_2ba7443e:


    "她垂着头。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_2d90cf9e:



    voice "2SA_1063"
    sachiko "「谁？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_2e272f79:



    voice "2MI_1161"
    miyako "「我是鹰冈圣夜子，来还备用品了」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_ba670e03:



    voice "2SA_1064"
    sachiko "「……请进」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_a01ee7f1:


    "祥子抬起头，换回了平常的表情。"




translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_77dbd388:


    voice "2SA_1055"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_09_3c93adb2:


    sachiko "「永久供养是不可能了，但在校舍更换前总还是有办法的吧。至少不会变成被遗忘的角落」"
